The problem is clear: when `transition.source == "*"` or `transition.source == "+"`, the code just adds `(transition.target, transition.name)` to `any_targets` or `any_except_targets`. But it doesn't check if `transition.target` is a `GET_STATE` or `RETURN_VALUE` instance that has `allowed_states`. 

